                         pReSENtS tAi AdSAddER 
                        Version: 1.0 [bUGfiXEd]

                    WRIttEN by rEdCR0W ^tAI/^Area51

                 


Introduction
~~~~~~~~~~~~
tAi AdSAddER is a tool that adds bbs-advertisements to an archive
and kills bbsads of other boards out of an archive !


Features 
~~~~~~~~
- You can add as many files as you want 
  [ansis, txt-files, little progs...]!
- You can kill a lot of bbsads from other boards (max. : 255 chars of names)
- Many archive types are supported : LHA,LZH,LZX & ZIP 
  (more in the next version)
- Cool outfit

Requirements
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
-LHA, LZX, ZIP [V2.01 or higher] in your c-dir!


Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
Create a directory in your cnet-dir called "bbsads".
Copy all of your ads that you wish to add to an uploaded archive to
this directory !!!

Copy the file "tAiAdSAddER.rexx" to your pfiles.


Load your prefered texteditor and change the following line 
of your bbstext :

1901 that says : TEST PASSED.
change it to   : TEST PASSED.#0pfiles:tAiAdSAddER.rexx}

SAVE YOUR BBSTEXT AND RELOAD IT !

CONFIGURE following lines in the file : "pfiles:tAiAdSAddER.rexx":

/***************** CONFIG *****************/

StartSize=10000; /* Start-Size of a File to call the tAi AdSAddER 
                    e.g. : The tAi AdSAddER won't be called if the 
                           size of a file is smaller than (with this config.) 
                           10 kb (=10000 bytes)!!! */   

Files2AD="cnet:bbsads/#?"; /* The directory where the bbsads 
                              (textfiles, ansis...) are !!! 
                              DON'T FORGET THE "#?" AT THE END OF THE PATH */

Files2KILL="#?.displayme fuck.txt #?.schaumichan"; 

/* 
   The names of the files
   to kill by tAi AdSAddER 
   NOT MORE THAN 255 CHARS 
   AND DON'T FORGET TO LEAVE A BLANK BETWEEN 2 NAMES !!! 
*/
 

/****** DO NOT CHANGE ANYTHING ELSE  ******/


VERY IMPORTANT !!!
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Your Subboard Flag "File Testing" has got to be at :"IMMEDIATE" !!!
The file will be tested immediatly and if the test is passed 
tAi AdSAddER will be called.
If the File Testing Flag is at "AMAINT" or "NO" tAi AdSAddER
won't be called in this subboard !

- USE ZIP-VERSION ZIP V2.01 OR HIGHER IN YOUR C-DIR !!! 
  OR BE SURE THAT YOUR ZIP_VERSION SUPPORTS "#?" !!! 


